# --- optional: checked only if present -------------------------------------------
# Three of the five classes docs/DATA.md section 5 lists as not archived are here. Two are
# not: step 2's download cache has no digest, and neither has the habitat relation cache
# with the ontology path cache beside it, which a fresh query answers with different data
# rather than with the same bytes. None of the five is in the archive. The three that are
# here are large and come from public sources, so a reader regenerates or re-fetches them
# (docs/DATA.md says how). The digests are of the files the analysis actually read, so a
# regeneration or a download can be compared against them; a mismatch on a re-fetched
# public file is information about drift in that source, not necessarily an error.
